ers"},{"text":"Transport accidents"},{"text":"Fire emergencies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emergency planning"},{"text":"Evacuation planning"},{"text":"Search and rescue coordination"},{"text":"Emergency communication"},{"text":"Incident management"},{"text":"Emergency operations centres"},{"text":"Relief coordination"},{"text":"Humanitarian logistics"},{"text":"Shelter management"},{"text":"Emergency health"},{"text":"Community preparedness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical and field skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Disaster risk assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hazard identification"},{"text":"Hazard mapping"},{"text":"Exposure assessment"},{"text":"Vulnerability assessment"},{"text":"Capacity assessment"},{"text":"Risk scoring"},{"text":"Risk matrices"},{"text":"Scenario development"},{"text":"Loss estimation"},{"text":"Critical infrastructure assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GIS and remote sensing"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"ArcGIS"},{"text":"Google Earth Engine"},{"text":"GPS/GNSS"},{"text":"Raster analysis"},{"text":"Spatial analysis"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Satellite imagery"},{"text":"Change detection"},{"text":"Flood mapping"},{"text":"Landslide mapping"},{"text":"Burn-area mapping"},{"text":"Damage assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency response"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emergency triage concepts"},{"text":"First aid"},{"text":"Basic life support"},{"text":"Evacuation"},{"text":"Shelter management"},{"text":"Search-and-rescue coordination"},{"text":"Emergency communication"},{"text":"Incident reporting"},{"text":"Resource allocation"},{"text":"Situation reporting"},{"text":"Field safety"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For hands-on medical or rescue skills, use recognised accredited training providers rather than treating online certificates as substitutes for practic